Christopher Eccleston!
-(APPLAUSE)

598
00:31:36,667 --> 00:31:39,267
你好吗？
请坐。
How are you?
Have a seat.

599
00:31:39,300 --> 00:31:40,700
谢谢。
Thank you.

600
